# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored.
#
# RevenueCat's Android SDK key. Public by design — it identifies the app, not
# the account — which is why it can carry the EXPO_PUBLIC_ prefix and be inlined
# into the bundle. The secret one is the Play service account JSON, and that
# lives in RevenueCat's dashboard, never in this repo (SPEC §7.4).
#
# Found at: RevenueCat → Project settings → API keys → Google Play (public key)
EXPO_PUBLIC_REVENUECAT_ANDROID_KEY=
